00:58:36.420 --> 00:58:43.810
<v Michael Paterniti>You really, I think, fall into a bit of an existential crisis. What the hell am I doing?
<v Michael Paterniti>你真的，我想，陷入了某种存在危机。我到底在做什么？

00:58:43.810 --> 00:58:56.280
